    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Observation:\n",
        "The comparison graph shows the accuracy, weighted precision, weighted recall, and weighted F1-score for Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and the DummyClassifier.\n",
        "\n",
        "Logistic Regression achieved the strongest overall performance in this experiment. Random Forest performed closer to the baseline model, while the DummyClassifier achieved reasonable accuracy only because it always predicted the majority class.\n",
        "\n",
        "The weighted scores should still be interpreted carefully because they give more influence to larger classes and may hide poor performance on minority classes."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "DobChsnhScy2"
      }
    },
